 </span><span begin="00:49.340" end="00:50.120">thinking</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:50.300" end="00:52.490"><span begin="00:50.300" end="00:50.630">My </span><span begin="00:50.630" end="00:51.140">heart </span><span begin="00:51.140" end="00:51.260">is </span><span begin="00:51.260" end="00:52.010">sinking </span><span begin="00:52.010" end="00:52.490">too</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:52.790" end="00:55.520"><span begin="00:52.790" end="00:53.240">It's </span><span begin="00:53.240" end="00:53.630">no </span><span begin="00:53.630" end="00:55.520">surprise</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:55.700" end="00:57.860"><span begin="00:55.700" end="00:55.970">I've </span><span begin="00:55.970" end="00:56.150">been </span><span begin="00:56.150" end="00:56.900">watching </span><span begin="00:56.900" end="00:57.080">you </span><span begin="00:57.080" end="00:57.860">lately</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.070" end="01:00.920"><span begin="00:58.070" end="00:58.430">I </span><span begin="00:58.430" end="00:58.790">want </span><span begin="00:58.790" end="00:59.000">to </span><span begin="00:59.000" end="00:59.510">make </span><span begin="00:59.510" end="00:59.750">it </span><span begin="00:59.750" end="01:00.080">with </span><span begin="01:00.080" end="01:00.920">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.050" end="01:09.260"><span begin="01:06.050" end="01:07.280">Destiny </span><span begin="01:07.280" end="01:07.670">has </span><span begin="01:07.670" end="01:07.820">a </span><span begin="01:07.820" end="01:08.720">funny </span><span begin="01:08.720" end="01:09.260">way</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.260" end="01:13.520"><span begin="01:09.260" end="01:09.620">When </span><span begin="01:09.620" end="01:09.800">it </span><span begin="01:09.800" end="01:10.460">comes </span><span begin="01:10.460" end="01:10.670">and </span><span begin="01:10.670" end="01:11.120">takes </span><span begin="01:11.120" end="01:11.390">all </span